{"candidateAnswer":"A mix of fiction, self-improvement books, and fantasy series","evidence":"[D4:10 | 4:17 pm on 2 August, 2023] John: I've been reading this inspiring book, it reminds me to keep dreaming.\n[D11:26 | 8:17 pm on 21 September, 2023] Tim: Great bookshelf! I saw that you had \"The Alchemist\" on there, one of my favorites. Did you enjoy it?\n[D17:9 | 3:36 pm on 11 November, 2023] John: Yep, I just finished this amazing fantasy series. It was a wild ride with so many twists. The author is amazing at creating awesome storylines and characters - I love getting lost in those fantasy worlds.\n[D19:16 | 10:22 am on 21 November, 2023] John: I love non-fiction books about personal development and mindset. They help me know myself better. Do you enjoy reading other types of books as well?\n[D19:20 | 10:22 am on 21 November, 2023] John: I recently finished rereading \"The Alchemist\" - it was really inspiring. It made me think again about following dreams and searching for our own personal legends. I felt really motivated and hopeful after reading it.\n[D22:12 | 7:42 pm on 8 December, 2023] John: I'm reading \"Dune\" by Frank Herbert. It's a great story about religion and human control over ecology. What about you? What's the last book that moved you?","itemId":"urn:uuid:9a67c74d-e927-5dc0-8f13-f4a10264e26a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:1a0f12e53155a6ed6942281235d1bb9a0407a1f25e1a92533ceca17f3ab8110d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What books has John read?","referenceAnswer":"inpsiring book on dreaming big, The Alchemist, fantasy series, non-fiction books on personal development, Dune","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"1a0f12e53155a6ed6942281235d1bb9a0407a1f25e1a92533ceca17f3ab8110d"}}]}